*/
ALIGN 4 
SupportDistanceLink:
WORD 3 
SupportRateKill:
WORD 5 
SupportRateCombat:
WORD 1 
SupportRateStaff:
WORD 2 
SupportRateDance:
WORD 2 
PlayerPhaseOnly:
WORD 0 // true if 1, false if 0 


